fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstcontext.html#gst_context_set_task_pool","fragment":"\n\tgst_context_set_task_pool\n\n\n\tGst.Context.prototype.set_task_pool\n\n\n\tGst.Context.set_task_pool\n\nSets pool on context as the task pool to be shared between elements.\nIf pool is NULL, any previously set task pool will be removed from\nthe context.\nParameters:\na GstContext\na GstTaskPool or NULL to unset\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets pool on context as the task pool to be shared between elements.\nIf pool is null, any previously set task pool will be removed from\nthe context.\nParameters:\na Gst.Context\na Gst.TaskPool or null to unset\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nSets pool on context as the task pool to be shared between elements.\nIf pool is None, any previously set task pool will be removed from\nthe context.\nParameters:\na Gst.Context\na Gst.TaskPool or None to unset\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});